  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.02 Reconfiguration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.02 “Reconfiguration” means the redesign of an existing legal structure within the same overall outside dimensions and without increasing the square footage of the surface area of the structure, such as moving a finger or “L” from one end of a dock walkway to another.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19",
